  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.2: Release notes metadata fix; same code as v1.4.1.\n\nv1.4.1: Critical fix for a deadlock introduced in 1.4.0. Synchronous Cache.Get called with a Task-returning populate (`await Cache.Get(..., async () => ...)`) could hang under single-threaded SynchronizationContexts (Blazor Server, WPF, WinForms) because the new eager size-estimator walked Task<T>.Result via JsonSerializer. Both RecomputeEstimatedSize and EstimateObjectSize now short-circuit when the value is a Task. Added a one-time Warning diagnostic (deduped per call site) that points sync-over-async callers at Cache.GetAsync. 100% backward compatible; recommended upgrade for all 1.4.0 users.",
